        "sid": "2KI 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál slahhángw mibaangw tawa mibaangw oo kurkú gwaleél oo waawuti'iimár Sedekia, Nebukadnesa waawutmoó Babuloni nee slaqwaruuseerós nina haratlayé' baraá gixsár Yerusalemu, kari harweér, koo/ír gawit kari tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsarí kana harwedaadiít, kurkú mibaá nee wak oo waawuti'iimár Sedekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál slahhángw tsiyáhh tawa gwaleél, qwari ina ló'wa tsimamiíhh baraá gixsaro, tam gár hee ir áfkwár kay iri qwát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam mukduú Babuloni gixsa ngaa harweeri'i badu sleémeero, slaqwaruusér Yuda dirka baraá koo/iro kari feé/, slaqwaruuse sleémeero tari ta'aaín xweeraawo ar loohír afkudá', dír koo/i tiwa dók dír iisaapoó asalmoó waawutmo. Waawutmo iri tláy ar loohír Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala slaqwaruusér Kaldayo waawutmo guri eehát guri aleesleér dír xatstá Yeriko, slaqwaruuseerós sleémeero guna geexeér tari diya/aát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmo nguri oohiyé' ngway huwiyé' amór waawutmoó Babuloni dir Ribla, inós guri sakwasleemuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo daaqaywós kuri tsuú/ dír ilaawós wa alé, inós sleeme kuri ila' tu/ún, alhhe'eesayhe nguri daba' tseegiyé' ar piíngu, nguri huwiyé' ay Babuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál slahhángw kooán tawa faanqw kurkú mibaá nee gwaleél oo waawuti'iimár Nebukadnesa waawutmoó Babuloni Nebusaradani geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruusér waawutmo, ina dáh baraá yaamaá Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guna daá/, nee doó waawutmoowo, nee mari sleémeerowo awa Yerusalemu, umuúqo doó ure guna ásltí qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqwaruusér Kaldayo sleémeero, tidár dinkwa nee geeraharusmoó xuumuuse koo/ír Yerusalemu ngina fee/iyé' bihhe sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebusaradani, geeraharusmoó xuumuusér waawutmo, muu sleémeero kudá meet baraá gixsa, nee kudá' sleémeero daber'ín ngaa haniisiye' dír waawutmoó Babuloni, guna loohatís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruuse mukduú narkuute guna geexáy as sabiíbu nguwa amohhe'eesiya' nee qamu ngiwa doosliya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Kaldayo uhmoodá' sirdaa/aát, kuduú baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kuna naasúy giqaango dinkwa nee kitaangós nee tlahhsár taa tleéhh ar muqslír sirdaa/aat, tidár baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nee muqslaadá' sirda/aten kari ar tláy ay yaamaá Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam sleeme hutli'i ngina ar tlayé', nee beleshi, nee makaási, nee hhaansa'aá ta gil'ór ohaahin qoomár barta mooyángw da/aa/án, nee xoosladár hatlá' ar muqslár sirda/aten, tidá' tar gadiyumamisi baraá Doó Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmooduú xuumuuse safuriyadu sleeme gina ar tláy, dinkwa nee búklaywo, nee umuúqo xooslár taa tleéhh ar saahaábu nee ar muqslár peésaaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam muqslaadá' sirda/ten sleémeero tidá' Solomon aa tleéhh ar uheemidá' tsár, nee birikadá' ur, nee kitangwdá' kay iwitiís baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, muqslaarí sirda/aten sleémeero ka qoomay wasl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú uhmoowo tlenaangós a miíta dakaát, gawaá ságw uhmoowo muqslár sirdaa/aat ar tlenaango miíta wak nee gár hhaawaaká i deer. Umuú ságw uhmoowo kuna harweér qaaliro ar slaqsa'aá mamaá komamaánga sleémeero ar muqslír sirdaa/aat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Nebusaradani geeraharusmoó úr oo xuumuusér waawutmo, Seraya kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú nee kaahamusmo Sefania kuduú alee/iisusmoowós, gina ar tláy dinkwa nee múk tám kudá' afér doó Mungú xumxaaxuúm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmoó wák guna ar tláy, kudá' askaárír geerahaár baraá slaqwaraaro, dinkwa nee múk kooán oo waawutmoó alee/iimamiís. Slám malé ale goousmoó geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruuse kudá' gooír muruú inslaslángwá hariím gu amohhe'eemiís, guna ar tláy, dinkwa nee múk mibeeri lahhoó' oo iiatleér kudá' aa baraá gixsár Yerusalemurí áy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebusaradani mukwí guna ar tláy, guri huúw amór waawutmoó Babuloni baraá Ribla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Nebukadnesa mukwí sleémeero guna Riblárí tsuú/ baraá yaamaá Hamati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, múk Yuda kuna ar tláy baraá yaamuuine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Nebukadnesa oo Babuloni Gedalia garmoó Ahikamu, nángw naangó Shafani, guna qaás tawa ga/aawusmoó muu sleémeero oo Yuda, kudá' taa huwiiká Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár geeraharuusér slaqwaruuse dinkwa nee muu sleémeero kaangwí kuwa axaás, adór waawutmoó Babuloni Gedalia ngura ga/aawusmooín wa qaás, inooín sleémeero niri amór Gedaliawí daqayé', baraá Mispa. Mukwí a Ishmaeli garmoó Netania, nee Yohanani garmoó Karea, nee Seraya garmoó Tanhumeti oo xoorór Netofati, nee Yesania garmoó heé Ma'aka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia lo'o gari /aáy dír geeraaín wa alé, iri oó, «Ma da'ayumiitaara' as waawituú Kaldayo, hooté' yaamuuká' wa ale, waawutmoó Babuloni na sagadiyusaak, daqaní kuungá' amohhooa a sleerá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
