        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár slahhángw faanqwe Ishmaeli garmoó Netania, nángw naangó Elishama, kuduú tlahhoó waawutmo, ina amór Gedalia káy inós dinkwa nee múk mibaangw, Gedalia nguri muxiyé', ngway gaasiyé'. Inós sleeme múk Yahudi nee oo Kaldayo kudá' baraá Mispárí dirií' guri tsuú/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy múk Israeli sleémeero, na/ii nee múk urene dinkwa nee geeraharuusér slaqwaruuseero, kudá' didá' diriiá', tari tláy ay yaamaá Misri, asma múk Kaldayo nguna da'ayutiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
