            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tám nee tsár Efil-merodaki waawutmoó Babuloni waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún, kurkuduú kilae Yehoyakini waawutmoó Yuda guri gurtláy, kunguna duúx baraá doó tseegamór wa alé. Tí iwa tleehharút bál mibeeri tsár nee faanqw slahhángw mibaá nee tsár. Kurkú mibeeri tám nee faanqw iimír Yehoyakini kuwa tseék. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós nee waawutmoó Babuloni tana axweés ar axweesantá tsuu', guri uráy haniís ta waawituú hatlá' sleémeero kuduú dinkwa nee inós baraá yaamaá Babuloniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Yehoyakini tlabaawós kudaá tseegamo giri duúx, awa hatlá' giri dahaás. Umuú deelooro ina /ayín doó waawutmoó wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós umuú deelooro gár i slai kan hanmiis nee waawutmo baraá hotaawós sleémeerowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
